      "created_at": "2019-07-10T07:38:44Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-07-10T07:38:44Z",
      "body": "It's an issue on the user's end.\r\nI've had the same issue initially on my end.\r\n\r\nCharacter Configuration > Log Window Settings > Log Filters > Announcements > Own Gathering Messages\r\n\r\nOwn Gathering Messages has to be checked in order for the game to log the data needed by the module.",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
