      "created_at": "2019-08-04T00:27:56Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-08-04T00:27:56Z",
      "body": "I was having this issue as well and it turns out the \"Hide Chat Log (for privacy)\" in the FFXIV plugin for ACT prevents the fisher module from detecting when the line is cast; at least for me anyways.",
